msgctxt "84_Tanimura"
msgid "Someone's threatening suicide?"
msgstr "¿Alguien está tratando de suicidarse?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "96_Officer"
msgid "That's right. There's a man on the roof that says he's going to jump."
msgstr "Así es. Aquel hombre en la terraza dice que va a saltar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "108_Tanimura"
msgid "We can't have him disturbing the peace like this. Let's get him down from there."
msgstr "No podemos dejar que perturbe la paz de esa manera. Bajémoslo de allí."

